flowchart TD

classDef wealth  fill:#1b4332,stroke:#1b4332,color:#fff
classDef move    fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#2d6a4f,color:#fff
classDef fund    fill:#0f3460,stroke:#0f3460,color:#fff
classDef out     fill:#16213e,stroke:#16213e,color:#fff

WEALTH([Private wealth]):::wealth

WEALTH -->|Net Worth Rises| CONTRIB[WDT contribution]:::move

CONTRIB --> FUND["Sovereign Wealth Fund (SWF)"]:::fund

FUND --> RES[Refund guarantee]:::out
RES  -->|Net Worth Falls| REFUND[WDT refund]:::move
REFUND  --> WEALTH
RES  --> DIV[Labour tax relief]:::out
DIV  --> INV[Public investment]:::out